<title>SOUTH AFRICA: M&amp;R, Alpha await merger decision.</title>
<headline>M&amp;R, Alpha await merger decision.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Murray &amp; Roberts Holdings Ltd (M&amp;R) and Alpha Ltd said on Monday that they were still awaiting a final decision by the minister of trade and industry on whether a proposed merger of Alpha with M&amp;R's Blue Circle cement business should go ahead.</p>
<p>On September 20 it was announced in a cautionary that the Competition Board had recommended to the minister that the merger should not be allowed to proceed.</p>
<p>The two companies advised shareholders on Monday to exercise caution in dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
